@startsalt
' Screen: Auto-Flagging Rules Settings
' User Stories:
'   - US-517: As a developer, I can create rules that automatically flag interactions matching criteria
'   - US-518: As a developer, I can enable/disable individual rules without deleting them
'   - US-519: As a developer, I can see how many matches each rule has produced

{
  <b>CodeFre.sh</b> | Settings | Captures | <b>Auto-Flagging Rules</b>
  ==
  {
    {
      <b>Auto-Flagging Rules</b>
      <i>Automatically flag agent interactions that match defined criteria</i>
    } |
    {
      [+ New Rule]
    }
  }
  ==
  {#
    <b>Name</b>                  | <b>Type</b>        | <b>Criteria</b>                        | <b>Reason / Tags</b>          | <b>Enabled</b>           | <b>Matches</b> | <b>Actions</b>
    High Latency Flag       | latency      | duration_ms > 8000               | deviation / latency        | (X) On  ( ) Off     | 247        | [Edit] [✕]
    Error Trace Capture     | attribute    | status = error                   | bug / error                | (X) On  ( ) Off     | 83         | [Edit] [✕]
    Keyword: escalation     | regex        | response matches /escalat|supervi/ | edge_case / escalation   | ( ) On  (X) Off     | 41         | [Edit] [✕]
  }
  ==
  {
    <b>+ New Rule</b>
    ==
    {
      <b>Rule Name</b>
      "                                                                    "
      --
      <b>Type</b>
      (X) <b>regex</b> — match span attribute or response text against pattern
      ( ) <b>attribute</b> — match a specific OTel attribute key/value pair
      ( ) <b>latency</b> — flag spans exceeding a duration threshold
      ( ) <b>token_count</b> — flag interactions exceeding token limits
      --
      <b>Criteria</b> <i>(regex type)</i>
      {
        <b>Target</b>                         | <b>Pattern</b>
        ^agent.response                  ^ | "/refund|compensation/i          "
      }
      --
      <b>Reason</b>
      ^edge_case                                                          ^
      --
      <b>Tags (applied to auto-flagged captures)</b>
      "billing ×" | "refund ×" | "add tag..." |
      --
      {
        [Cancel] | [Save Rule]
      }
    }
  }
}
@endsalt
